    "section_7YAPWW": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "text_yG9J9f": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Product details",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3><strong>Product details</strong></h3>",
            "width": "fit-content",
            "max_width": "narrow",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "accordion_JHMifY": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "name": "Accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "plus",
            "dividers": true,
            "type_preset": "h4",
            "inherit_color_scheme": true,
            "color_scheme": "",
            "border": "none",
            "border_width": 1,
            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_VyFryh": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "The Problem",
                "open_by_default": true,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_McjMWz": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Every time you check a bag, you hand the airline $45 to $50 each way. That's $90 to $100 per round trip, before overweight penalties, delays, or the 45 minutes you'll never get back waiting at baggage claim.</p><p>And it adds up fast:</p><ul><li>$50–$75 overweight penalties</li><li>$30–$60 carry-on fees on budget airlines</li><li>26 million bags mishandled every year</li><li>$400–$800+ per year for a family of 4</li></ul><p>You've tried rolling. You've tried packing cubes. You've tried sitting on your suitcase. None of it works because none of it solves the real problem: your clothes take up too much space.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-primary--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_McjMWz"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_DUeX4N": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "The Solution",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_gVNPUh": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Voltairs compresses your clothes to 40% of their original size, so the space problem is gone before you even get to the airport.</p><ul><li>Fit 10 days of clothes in a single carry-on</li><li>No checked luggage needed</li><li>No baggage claim. No overweight fees. No waiting.</li></ul><p>One kit. Two bags. Zero baggage fees. It pays for itself on the very first flight.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-primary--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_gVNPUh"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_xAtTAH": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What's in the Kit",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_9gAcB8": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<ul><li>2× Vacuum Travel Bags (18.5\" × 11.8\" × 5.9\"): fits any carry-on or backpack, holds 8–10 days of clothes each</li><li>1× Free 30W Multi-Function Air Pump: deflates bags in seconds, doubles as a reading light and emergency torch<br/></li></ul>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-primary--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_9gAcB8"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_9i7Yj6": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How It Works",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_wrXDgQ": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p><strong>Step 1: Pack</strong><br/>Fill the bag with clothes. Up to 18–22 lbs capacity per bag.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Compress</strong><br/>Connect the pump. Watch your clothes shrink to less than half their size in seconds.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Go</strong><br/>Drop it in your carry-on. Skip check-in. Skip baggage claim. Keep the fee.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-primary--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "",
